{"version":1,"content":"<p>ViuTV今年4月宣布翻拍經典日劇《悠長假期》，並由MIRROR成員呂爵安（Edan）與李佳芯（Ali）領銜主演，分別挑戰木村拓哉及山口智子飾演的經典角色「瀨名秀俊」與「葉山南」。</p><p>時隔半年，劇集終於宣告煞科，並獲安排於今年12月火速播映。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:41:13.872522+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:05:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:35.407226+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:37:37.851616+00:00","content_hash":"720698cd53e5384f493fe332657a16a8035a148bf7e329fa51e76f2f3c0836c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}